# 副簽
(pos:名詞)
<explanation>
yue:文件或者合約上面，除咗正簽之外，另外加簽嘅名字或者印章，通常用嚟確認或者備案（量詞：個、張）
eng:counter-signature; duplicate signature
<eg>
yue:呢份合約要正簽同副簽齊晒先至生效。 (ni1 fan6 hap6 lou3 jiu3 zing3 cim1 tung4 fuk3 cim1 cai4 saai3 sin1 zi3 saang1 haau6.)
eng:This contract is only effective when both the primary and counter-signatures are complete. [end of text]


